{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-12-15 07:00:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., DEC. 15, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA”) (NASDAQ: XRAY), ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.125\xa0PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, AN INDICATED ANNUAL RATE OF\xa0$0.50\xa0PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 13, 2023 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 30, 2022.'}